# EVE repo -- universal build/OS cruft (applies to every subfolder)
# signal_design/Python_Implementation/ has its OWN .gitignore for station artifacts
# (*.sigmf-data, *_spec.png, *_schedule.*). This root file handles the cruft everywhere.

# python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo

# node (if build_deck.js pulls pptxgenjs via npm)
node_modules/

# macOS + zip cruft
.DS_Store
__MACOSX/
